endama-shaped flash drive as a weapon. Unbound by anyone, they leap to avoid danger.","abilities":["Briefly takes off when colliding with <'Certain Fates'>, blocked, or encountering a Hole."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":5000,"atk":300,"def":50,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"suiton_ninja":{"slug":"suiton_ninja","name":"Suiton Ninja","icon":"/enemies-icons/Suiton Ninja.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A ninja who can spin in place for a long time. He claims that there is water surrounding him; your vision is just too poor to see it. Never stops spinning unless tripped.","abilities":["Deals Physical damage to surroundings while spinning, and stops spinning when shifted","Bounces <'Certain Fates'>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":600,"def":500,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.5}},"mio":{"slug":"mio","name":"Mio","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mio.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Drive out oni, and you drive out dreams. Welcome in curses, and you welcome in kindness. Ask not of right or wrong, or good and evil. She simply draws her sword in silence.","abilities":["Attacks hit 2 times","[Icy Gaze] After several attacks, the next attack strikes twice with higher damage","Bounces <'Certain Fates'>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":50000,"atk":777,"def":900,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"kouhei_mifune":{"slug":"kouhei_mifune","name":"Kouhei Mifune","icon":"/enemies-icons/Kouhei Mifune.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damag